**Optimizing function catalog extraction**
**Managing output token limits**
codex
The revised insertion trigger preserves revocations and checks them after the authorization waits. Restore also 
rejects room conversations whose space was deleted. I’ve confirmed T28 is installed locally through a connection 
forced into read-only mode; next I’ll check implicit FK locks and the migration’s lock order.
exec
"C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe" -Command "@'
const { Client } = require('pg');
const fs = require('fs');
(async () => {
 const c = new 
Client({host:'127.0.0.1',port:54322,user:'postgres',password:'[REDACTED_SECRET]',database:'postgres',options:'-c 
default_transaction_read_only=on -c statement_timeout=10000'});
 await c.connect();
 const funcs=(await c.query(\"select p.proname,n.nspname,p.prosrc,p.proacl::text as 
acl,p.prosecdef,p.proconfig,p.oid::regprocedure::text as name from pg_proc p join pg_namespace n on 
